  m_Text: 'Save files: Export on source; Import old save here.

    Preview before
    replacing the current save.


    LAN Sync (native builds, same network):

    Open
    source first, then receiver; confirm scores.

    Only ID + scores transfer,
    not gameplay.


    Legacy cloud restoration is unavailable.

    The ID/Receive
    entry cannot recover old cloud data.'
